catflow 0.8
1. Read Images   site-images/
2. <each alt_one; on_error=skip>   [image] -> [text]
     1. Describe Image   (input:1)   LFM2-VL 1.6B; "One-sentence alt text:
                                     factual, specific, no 'image of'"
3. Join Text     separator="\n"
4. Save Text     alt-text.txt
